-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-2023-d85668.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/press-23.jpg\" alt=\"100 nơi làm việc tốt nhất Việt Nam 2023\" title data-slide-to=\"28\" data-bs-slide-to=\"28\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"https://doanhtri.net/tin-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-2023-d85668.html\" class=\"text-primary title-link\" target=\"_blank\"><b>100 Nơi Làm Việc Tốt Nhất Việt Nam® 2023</b></a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><a href=\"https://doanhtri.net/tin-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-2023-d85668.html\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i>doanhtri.net</i></a></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Ngoài những doanh nghiệp quen thuộc Nestlé Việt Nam, FPT, năm nay có thêm nhiều nhân tố mới lần đầu lọt top 100 nơi làm việc tốt nhất Việt Nam là CJ Foods, Jollibee, BIM Group...<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"https://doanhtri.net/tin-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-2023-d85668.html\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Xem thêm <span class=\"mbrib-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 14px\"></span></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image сol-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-post1589886.tpo\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/press-9.jpg\" alt=\"Công bố top 100 Nơi làm việc tốt nhất Việt Nam năm 2023\" title data-slide-to=\"29\" data-bs-slide-to=\"29\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-post1589886.tpo\" class=\"text-primary title-link\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Công bố top 100 Nơi Làm Việc Tốt Nhất Việt Nam® năm 2023</b></a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-post1589886.tpo\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i>tienphong.vn</i></a></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Tối 23/11, bảng xếp hạng \"Nơi làm việc tốt nhất Việt Nam\" do Anphabe tổ chức, được sự bảo trợ của Liên đoàn Thương mại và Công nghiệp Việt Nam (VCCI), đã chính thức được công bố...<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"https://tienphong.vn/cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-post1589886.tpo\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Xem thêm <span class=\"mbrib-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 14px\"></span></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image сol-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.tbngaynay.vn/anphabe-chinh-thuc-cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-a113399.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/press-17.jpg\" alt=\"Anphabe chính thức công bố Top 100 Nơi làm việc tốt nhất Việt Nam năm 2023\" title data-slide-to=\"30\" data-bs-slide-to=\"30\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Top 100 Nơi Làm Việc Tốt Nhất Việt Nam® 2023</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><a href=\"https://www.tbngaynay.vn/anphabe-chinh-thuc-cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-a113399.html\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i>doanhnhanthitruong.vn</i></a></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Bảng xếp hạng này là kết quả của sự đánh giá khách quan từ 63.878 người làm việc có kinh nghiệm và 9.638 sinh viên, đại diện cho 18 nhóm ngành nghề và 113 trường đại học...<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"https://www.tbngaynay.vn/anphabe-chinh-thuc-cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-a113399.html\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Xem thêm <span class=\"mbrib-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 14px\"></span></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image сol-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.tbngaynay.vn/anphabe-chinh-thuc-cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-a113399.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/press-14.jpg\" alt=\"Anphabe chính thức công bố Top 100 Nơi làm việc tốt nhất Việt Nam năm 2023\" title data-slide-to=\"31\" data-bs-slide-to=\"31\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"https://www.tbngaynay.vn/anphabe-chinh-thuc-cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-a113399.html\" class=\"text-primary title-link\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Anphabe chính thức công bố Top 100 Nơi Làm Việc Tốt Nhất Việt Nam® năm 2023</b></a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><a href=\"https://www.tbngaynay.vn/anphabe-chinh-thuc-cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-a113399.html\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i>tbngaynay.vn</i></a></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Tối 23/11, bảng xếp hạng \"Nơi làm việc tốt nhất Việt Nam\" do Anphabe tổ chức, được sự bảo trợ của Liên đoàn Thương mại và Công nghiệp Việt Nam (VCCI), đã chính thức được công bố...</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"https://www.tbngaynay.vn/anphabe-chinh-thuc-cong-bo-top-100-noi-lam-viec-tot-nhat-viet-nam-nam-2023-a113399.html\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Xem thêm <span class=\"mbrib-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 14px\"></span></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image сol-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://en.vietnamplus.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced/271863.vnp\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/press-27.jpg\" alt=\"Top 100 Vietnam Best Places to Work announced\" title data-slide-to=\"32\" data-bs-slide-to=\"32\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"https://en.vietnamplus.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced/271863.vnp\" class=\"text-primary title-link\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Top 100 Vietnam Best Places to Work® announced</b></a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><a href=\"https://en.vietnamplus.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced/271863.vnp\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i>en.vietnamplus.vn</i></a></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">HCM City (VNS/VNA) - Anphabe, the consulting firm that provides Employer Brand and Happy Workforce solutions, has announced the annual list of Top 100 Vietnam Best Places to Work for 2023...<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"https://en.vietnamplus.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced/271863.vnp\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Xem thêm <span class=\"mbrib-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 14px\"></span></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image сol-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://vietnamnews.vn/economy/1637096/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced.html#google_vignette\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/press-14.jpg\" alt=\"Top 100 Vietnam Best Places to Work announced\" title data-slide-to=\"33\" data-bs-slide-to=\"33\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"https://vietnamnews.vn/economy/1637096/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced.html#google_vignette\" class=\"text-primary title-link\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Top 100 Vietnam Best Places to Work® announced</b></a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><a href=\"https://vietnamnews.vn/economy/1637096/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced.html#google_vignette\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i>vietnamnews.vn</i></a></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The rankings are based on the findings of the independent Vietnam Best Places to Work survey, which polled 63,878 experienced workers from 18 industry groups and 9,638 students from 113 universities...<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"https://vietnamnews.vn/economy/1637096/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced.html#google_vignette\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Xem thêm <span class=\"mbrib-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image сol-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <a href=\"https://en.nhandan.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced-post131481.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/press-17.jpg\" alt=\"Top 100 Vietnam Best Places to Work announced\" title data-slide-to=\"34\" data-bs-slide-to=\"34\"></a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><a href=\"https://en.nhandan.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced-post131481.html\" class=\"text-primary title-link\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Top 100 Vietnam Best Places to Work® announced</b></a></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\"><a href=\"https://en.nhandan.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced-post131481.html\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><i>en.nhandan.vn</i></a></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The survey was conducted from April to September 2023, measuring the employer brand attractiveness of 752 companies and also evaluating the latest trends in talent, human resources and working environment...<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"https://en.nhandan.vn/top-100-vietnam-best-places-to-work-announced-post131481.html\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Xem thêm <span class=\"mbrib-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
